{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26119","headline":"赋得芙蓉出水 · 贾謩","name":"赋得芙蓉出水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"的皪舒芳艳，红姿映绿苹。\n摇风开细浪，出沼媚清晨。\n翻影初迎日，流香暗袭人。\n独披千叶浅，不竞百花春。\n鱼戏参差动，龟游次第新。\n涉江如可采，从此免迷津。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾謩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26119.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26119","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}